{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A stock-themed roguelike deckbuilder where the market you create can just as easily crush you.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/3a86eaaf7312a92179a97983c3dbde0f.poster.avif?t=1763406928\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/3a86eaaf7312a92179a97983c3dbde0f.webm?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/3a86eaaf7312a92179a97983c3dbde0f.mp4?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Cards Dictate the Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a trading simulator. The market reacts to every card you play, spiraling higher or plunging without warning. Stack synergies, trigger price swings, and take control so your own momentum won't bankrupt you. Leverage the spikes and dips to turn market volatility into your weapon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/ed4e0a9cc8ab0a4a799ca91c630e05a7.poster.avif?t=1763406928\" width=800 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/ed4e0a9cc8ab0a4a799ca91c630e05a7.webm?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/ed4e0a9cc8ab0a4a799ca91c630e05a7.mp4?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Over Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the market in each run, creating opportunities and risks as you build towards your weekly financial target. Push too hard and the cost of entry skyrockets. Play it too safe and the market slips away. Success comes from market manipulation and not just watching prices go up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/0972b6c3517bf99a5440cb6c17083ccd.poster.avif?t=1763406928\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/0972b6c3517bf99a5440cb6c17083ccd.webm?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/0972b6c3517bf99a5440cb6c17083ccd.mp4?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Need More than Luck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the rhythm of the market to turn uncertainty into control. Rewards come through pattern recognition, timing, and steady growth rather than chance. Each session is a calculated gamble where ambition meets restraint. Do you ride the trend or sit it out?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/92fbfd1317a11ced3f82e3d861e37cd1.poster.avif?t=1763406928\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/92fbfd1317a11ced3f82e3d861e37cd1.webm?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/92fbfd1317a11ced3f82e3d861e37cd1.mp4?t=1763406928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is This Trading?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope.<i> Insider Trading</i> is a razor-sharp roguelike deckbuilder dressed up like Wall Street. Outplay the market, amass a fortune, and make Warren Buffett cry. The best part? You won't lose your life savings playing it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3166810?t=1763406928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/cbcffe4bd66f880ca0bb081b48eb357e094e1e09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763406928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/bbfc678045781da6964b347b69a72793ae7f4d1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763406928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/bbfc678045781da6964b347b69a72793ae7f4d1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763406928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3271420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Content Creation &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create and stream content as long as you include a link to the store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no copyrighted music or AI-generated content.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A stock-themed roguelike deckbuilder where the market you create can just as easily crush you.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </